abstract: >-
  Experimental infrastructure for comparing approximate machine unlearning to
  distributions of independently retrained models. Current software includes
  development pilots; no confirmed machine-unlearning effectiveness result is
  established. Code is proprietary and subject to the repository LICENSE.
